@startuml 
title ** DetailStatement **

actor Admin
participant BackOffice 
participant Settle.Worker 
participant GetBetDetail.API #99FF99

database  TpBetRecord
database  WagerTable  
database  TpDetailTodo  #99FF99
database  TpBetRecordDetail #99FF99
participant TP.Detail.Worker  #99FF99
participant TP.Helper  #99FF99

Group GetDetail by TP.Detail.Worker
Settle.Worker-> Settle.Worker: 定期執行
Settle.Worker -> TpBetRecord : Insert / Update \n Settle BetRecord 
TpBetRecord -> TpDetailTodo :  Insert \n TpId、TransId
TP.Detail.Worker-> TP.Detail.Worker: 定期執行
TP.Detail.Worker -> TpDetailTodo : Select TransId \n By TpId
TpDetailTodo -> TP.Detail.Worker : Get TransId
TP.Detail.Worker -> TP.Helper:TransId
TP.Helper -> ThirdPartyAPI :TransId
ThirdPartyAPI -> ThirdPartyAPI :Get Bet Detail
ThirdPartyAPI -> TP.Helper : Bet Detail
TP.Helper -> TP.Detail.Worker : Bet Detail
TP.Detail.Worker ->  TpBetRecordDetail : Insert / Update \n Bet Detail
alt Success
    TP.Detail.Worker ->  TpDetailTodo : Delete TransId
else Fail
    TP.Detail.Worker ->  TpDetailTodo : 等待下一次執行
end


END

GROUP BackOffice Search
Admin -> BackOffice:Search Bet Detail
BackOffice -> GetBetDetail.API:TpId、TransId\n 、GameType
alt TP.Detail.Worker
    GetBetDetail.API -> TpBetRecordDetail:Get Detail data
    TpBetRecordDetail -> GetBetDetail.API:Detail Data
else Wager..Worker
    GetBetDetail.API -> WagerTable : Get Detail data
    WagerTable -> GetBetDetail.API:Detail Data
end
GetBetDetail.API -> GetBetDetail.API: Detail Data \nMapping Interface \nby TpCategory
GetBetDetail.API -> BackOffice
BackOffice -> Admin : TpCategory \nDetail
END
@enduml